        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.achp.gov/preserve-america/community/hidalgo-texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Spanish colonizers first settled the area in 1749, keeping it under Spanish rule until 1821.",
