      ],
      "source": "https://www.achp.gov/preserve-america/community/hidalgo-texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The county enjoys a subtropical, humid climate with an average annual temperature of 73°F and 23 inches of rain.",
